WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
How do you feel about yourself? Are you proud of yourself? This is an inside game. If you want to

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.960
have more self-confidence, more self-love, more self-belief, it's about how do you feel about

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:13.600
yourself. Not what other people tell you, not what looks good on Instagram or YouTube. How do you feel

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.280
about yourself? People I think fall into two buckets. One, you'll have people who set really

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.760
small goals and then achieve them and then they get celebrated and you might feel good because

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.600
you posted that win on Instagram, you made a YouTube video and you can show off about how

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.000
great you are but really you know that you could have done more. You just set your sights way too

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.640
low, right? I use the example of running a race against three-year-olds. Great, you could win that

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.040
race against three-year-olds. You can do it. You can do it blindfolded. You could do it maybe even

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:50.640
crawling. Maybe. You can win that race pretty easily though and winning that race might get

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:55.280
you a little medal and you can post about on Instagram and show off how you won and you can

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:59.280
get all these accolades and people cheering you on that you know you're capable of more.

